   "text": "Requirements\n\n- Your army must include at least 1 Chaos Lord upgraded with Nostromo Nobility.\n- Your Warlord must have the Nostromo Nobility upgrade.\n- Your army may not include units with the Unique Keyword.\n- Your army must include at least 2 units of Contekar Terminators.\n\nBenefits\n\n- You may field Contekar Terminators as Troops choices.\n- Any unit in your army except for Inductii may purchase the Nostromo Nobility upgrade for 25pts.\n- Contemptor Dreadnoughts may purchase Trophies of Judgement for 15pts.",
